I was nearly level with Minamizaki-san, and nearly 1 kilo behind <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd keep up this pace until the 45-minute mark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hold the gap to <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-san</STYLE> within 1 kilo, and at the same time stay just a little ahead of Minamizaki-san.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
